0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;3&#x02013;5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">167 (37.0)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9781 (17.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.69 (3.78&#x02013;5.83)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.12 (0.87&#x02013;1.45)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02265;6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">122 (27.0)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1957 (3.5)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.13 (13.49&#x02013;21.76)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.12 (1.55&#x02013;2.89)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" colspan="5" rowspan="1">Number of prenatal visits, <italic>n</italic> (%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;0&#x02013;5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100 (22.12)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">11 222 (19.85)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.00</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.00</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;6&#x02013;11</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">239 (52.88)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31 275 (55.33)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.86 (0.68&#x02013;1.08)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.84 (0.65&#x02013;1.09)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02265;12</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">113 (25.0)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14 032 (24.82)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.90 (0.69&#x02013;1.18)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.89 (0.66&#x02013;1.21)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Emergency department visit/hospitalisation, <italic>n</italic> (%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">393 (87.0)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">49 808 (88.1)</